  ('dev-pure-function', 'developer', 'pure function', '纯函数', 'n.', 'A function whose output depends only on its inputs and that produces no side effects.', 'Keeping the calculation as a pure function made it trivial to unit test.', '把这个计算写成纯函数，让单元测试变得非常简单。', ARRAY['fp', 'coding']::text[], null, null, 54, true),
